  "notes": "Released in three sizes (135M, 360M, 1.7B), each as a base and an Instruct checkpoint; the Hub repositories were created on 2024-07-14 and 2024-07-15, the blog is dated 2024-07-16. The Instruct checkpoints were updated in place to v0.2 on 2024-08-18 (alignment handbook News, card changelog); v0.1 stays available as revision v0.1, so the update has no record of its own. Trained from scratch on SmolLM-Corpus, no base model. The id carries -1 because huggingface.smollm is the family id."
